  "text": "\r\n<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN\" >\r\n<HTML>\r\n  <!--%@ OutputCache Duration=60 VaryByParam=\"flora_id;taxon_id\"  %-->\r\n\r\n<head>\r\n<!-- Google Tag Manager -->\r\n<script>(function(w,d,s,l,i){w[l]=w[l]||[];w[l].push({'gtm.start':\r\nnew Date().getTime(),event:'gtm.js'});var f=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0],\r\nj=d.createElement(s),dl=l!='dataLayer'?'&l='+l:'';j.async=true;j.src=\r\n'https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtm.js?id='+i+dl;f.parentNode.insertBefore(j,f);\r\n})(window,document,'script','dataLayer','GTM-TGK4SMV');</script>\r\n<!-- End Google Tag Manager -->\r\n<title>Ambrosia in Trees and shrubs of the Andes of Ecuador @ efloras.org</title>\r\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href='/templates/eflora.css' />\r\n<script src=\"JavaScript/eflora.js\" type=\"text/javascript\" ></script>\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n\r\n  <!-- body onload=\"formMOMap.submit()\" -->\r\n  <body>\r\n\r\n    <TABLE id=\"TableMain\" cellSpacing=\"1\" cellPadding=\"1\" width=\"640\" border=\"0\">\r\n      <TR>\r\n        <TD><!--%@ Register TagPrefix=\"ucFlora\" TagName=\"TaxonSearchBox\" Src=\"TaxonSearchBox.ascx\" %-->\r\n\r\n<script language=\"javascript\">\r\n\r\nfunction jsClearTextBox(sender)\r\n{\r\n  // alert(formSearchBox[\"name_str\"].id);\r\n  // alert(sender.value);\r\n  if (sender.value == \"taxon name\")\r\n  {\r\n    sender.value = \"\";\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\n</script>\r\n<table id=\"ucEfloraHeader_tableHeaderWrapper\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n\t<tr>\r\n\t\t<TD style=\"WIDTH: 479px\"><a id=\"ucEfloraHeader_linkFloraHome\" title=\"Flora Homepage\" href=\"flora_page.aspx?flora_id=201\"><img src=\"images/flora/eflora-logo-201.gif\" id=\"ucEfloraHeader_imageLogo\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Link to Trees and shrubs of the Andes of Ecuador home\" /><br>\r\n        </a></TD>\r\n\t\t<TD valign=\"bottom\" align=\"right\">\r\n      <div id=\"ucEfloraHeader_panelSearchBox\">\r\n\t\t\t <!-- begin of search box -->\r\n        <FORM name=\"formSearchBox\" action=\"browse.aspx\" method=\"get\">\r\n          <TABLE borderColor=\"#ccffcc\" cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"2\" width=\"200\" border=\"1\">\r\n            <TR>\r\n              <TD>\r\n                <span id=\"ucEfloraHeader_lblSearchBox\"><INPUT TYPE='Hidden' NAME='flora_id' ' id='flora_id' VALUE='201' >\n&nbsp;<input id=name_str name=name_str &nbsp;  value=''  class=small title='Use % as the wildcard\r\n(e.g. pinus % or pinus a%)'  onfocus='jsClearTextBox(this);' accessKey=s size=15> <input class=small type=submit value=Search name=btnSearch><br>\n <input name=chkAllFloras type=checkbox   > <span class=small>All Floras &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<A HREF='search_page.aspx?flora_id=201'  TARGET='_top'  class='a.link.small'>Advanced Search</A></span>\n</span></TD>\r\n            </TR>\r\n          </TABLE>\r\n        </FORM> <!-- end of search box -->\r\n      \r\n\t\t</div>\r\n    </TD>\r\n\t</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n</TD>\r\n      </TR>\r\n      <TR>\r\n        <TD id=\"tdSubHeader\">\r\n<table id=\"FooterTableOut\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td bgcolor=\"#999999\"><img src=\"~/images/layout/dot.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"100%\" height=\"1\"></td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <TD>\r\n      <table bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" id=\"footerTable\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n        <tr>\r\n          <td style=\"WIDTH: 291px\">Andes Trees</td>\r\n          <TD align=\"right\">\r\n            <span id=\"ucEfloraSubHeader_lblLinks\"><a target='_top' href='/login.aspx'>Login</a>\n | <A HREF='/index.aspx'  TARGET='_top' >eFloras Home</A> | <A HREF='/help_page.aspx'  TARGET='_top' >Help</A></span></TD>\r\n        </tr>\r\n      </table>\r\n    </TD>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td bgcolor=\"#999999\"><img src=\"~/images/layout/dot.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"100%\" height=\"1\"></td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n</table>\r\n</TD>\r\n      </TR>\r\n      <TR>\r\n        <TD id=\"tdBody\">\r\n          <table id=\"tableBody\" cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n            <tr>\r\n              <td id=\"tdLeftBar\" valign=\"top\" width=\"0\"></td>\r\n\r\n              <td id=\"tdContent\" vAlign=\"top\" width=\"1930\">\r\n                <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n                  <tr>\r\n                    <td vAlign=\"top\">\r\n                      <table id=\"tableTaxonChain\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"1\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n\t<tr>\r\n\t\t<td><span id=\"lblTaxonChain\"><font size=\"2\"><A HREF='flora_page.aspx?flora_id=201'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='Flora homepage' >Andes Trees</A> | <A HREF='browse.aspx?flora_id=201'  TARGET='_top' >Family List</A> | <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=201&taxon_id=10074'  TARGET='_top' >Asteraceae</A> <A HREF='browse.aspx?flora_id=201&start_taxon_id=10074'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='lower taxa' ><img border='0' src='images/layout/icon-list.gif'></A></font></span></td>\r\n\t</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n                      <P></P>\r\n                      <div id=\"panelTaxonTreatment\">\r\n\t\r\n                        <span id=\"lblTaxonDesc\"><!-- Default Template -->\r\n15. <b>Ambrosia</b> L.\n<p>Nombres vernáculos: Altamisa, Marco, Marcu.  \r\n<P>\r\n\r\n<P>\r\n\r\n<P>\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\nArbustos, sufrútices o hierbas; toda la planta con glándulas, aromática. Hojas alternas, pinnatidisectas. Flores masculinas y femeninas en cabezuelas separadas a menudo en la misma planta. Cabezuelas masculinas en espigas o racimos terminales; involucro cupuliforme, brácteas lateralmente connatas; receptáculo con páleas. Flores masculinas modificadas, cáliz o vilano ausente, corola hialina, campanulada, 5-lobulada; estambres 5 alternado con los lóbulos de la corola; pistilodio reducido. Cabezuelas femeninas en grupos axilares en las hojas y sosteniendo los racimos masculinos; brácteas unidas y formando un receptáculo en forma de vaso; ápices de las brácteas espiniscentes, brácteas arregladas en varias formas o dispersas en el involucro durante la fructificación; páleas ausentes; una  a pocas flores. Flores femeninas reducidas, perianto ausente, androceo ausente; ovario maduro obovado, estilo corto, estigma lobulado, superficies estigmáticas papilosas, exertas a través de los ápices espinosos del involucro. Aquenios prismáticos, con pelos uniseriados,  formando complejos con el involucro.<p>\r\n\r\nEl género Ambrosia consta de 42 especies ampliamente distribuidas, en especial en oeste de América del Norte. En el Ecuador está representada una especie que crece en todo el callejón interandino: Ambrosia arborescens Miller.<p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\nNotas:  El género Franseria Cav. se considera sinónimo.<p>\r\nUsos: Insecticida contra las pulgas; para limpiar hornos; medicinal.<p>\r\nReferencias:\n<br>Correa Q., J. E. y H. Y. Bernal. 1990. Franseria artemisioides. Pp. 464–467 en: Especies promisorias vegetales de los países del Convenio Andrés Bello. Tomo V. SECAB Ciencia y Tecnología 17, Bogotá.\n<br>Payne, W. W. 1964. A re-evaluation of the genus Ambrosia (Compositae). J. Arnold Arbor. 45: 401–438.<p>\r\n<P>\r\n</span>\r\n                        <P><!-- Key -->\r\n                        </P> \r\n                        <P>\r\n                          <span id=\"lblLowerTaxonList\"></span></P>\r\n                        <BR clear=\"all\">\r\n                        <P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n                        <table id=\"tableObjectList\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"4\" width=\"100%\" border=\"1\">\r\n\t\t<tr bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\">\r\n\t\t\t<TD>\r\n                              <TABLE cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n                                <TR>\r\n                                  <TD>\r\n                                    <span id=\"Label1\"><font size=\"2\">\r\n                                      <b>Related Objects</b>\r\n                                    </font></span></TD>\r\n                                  <TD align=\"right\">\r\n                                    <span id=\"lblGalleryLink\"><font size=\"1\"></font></span>&nbsp;</TD>\r\n                                </TR>\r\n                              </TABLE>\r\n                            </TD>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<TD>\r\n                              <span id=\"lblObjectList\"><p>\n<TABLE  WIDTH='100%' BORDER='0' \n\t cellspacing=0>\n<TR >\n  <td class='bold'>Flora of Chile</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td width=400><li><A HREF='https://images.mobot.org/efloras/FloraData/060/PDF/V04/Volume4-Part1_Ambrosia.pdf' \n\tTITLE='PDF' >PDF</A></td>\n  <td class='small'>PDF</td>\n</TR>\n</TABLE>\n</span></TD>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</table>\r\n\t\r\n                        <P></P>\r\n                      \r\n</div>\r\n                      <P><div id=\"panelTaxonLinks\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</P>\r\n                      <P>\r\n                        <table id=\"tableLinkList\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"4\" width=\"100%\" border=\"1\">\r\n\t\t<tr bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\">\r\n\t\t\t<TD><span id=\"lblLinkTitle\"><font size=\"2\"><b>Related Links</b> (opens in a new window)</font></span></TD>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<TD>\r\n                              <P><span id=\"lblLinkList\"><b>Treatments in Other Floras @ www.efloras.org</b><ul>\n<li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=3&taxon_id=101325'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='treatment in Chinese Plant Names' >Chinese Plant Names</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=60&taxon_id=101325'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='treatment in Flora of Chile' >Flora of Chile</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=2&taxon_id=101325'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='treatment in Flora of China' >Flora of China</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=11&taxon_id=101325'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='treatment in Flora of Missouri' >Flora of Missouri</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=1&taxon_id=101325'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='treatment in Flora of North America' >Flora of North America</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=101&taxon_id=101325'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='treatment in Flora of Taiwan Checklist' >Flora of Taiwan Checklist</A></ul>\n<p>\n<b>Other Databases</b>\n<ul>\n\n<li><A HREF='http://mobot.mobot.org/cgi-bin/search_pick?name=Ambrosia'  TARGET='FLORA_LINK' \n\tTITLE='W3TROPICOS' >W<SUP>3</SUP>TROPICOS</A>\n<li><A HREF='http://www.ipni.org/ipni/IpniServlet?family=&infrafamily=&genus=Ambrosia&infragenus=&species=&infraspecies=&author_abbrev=&publication_title=&is_apni_record=on&is_gci_record=on&is_ik_record=on&include_authors=on&include_basionym_authors=on&query_type=by_query'  TARGET='FLORA_LINK' \n\tTITLE='IPNI' >IPNI</A>\n<li><A HREF='http://ravenel.si.edu/botany/ing//INGsearch.cfm?searchWord=Ambrosia'  TARGET='FLORA_LINK' \n\tTITLE='ING' >ING Genus Search</A></ul>\n</span></P>\r\n                            </TD>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</table>\r\n\t\r\n                        \r\n</div></P>\r\n                    </td>\r\n                  </tr>\r\n                  <tr>\r\n                    <td>\r\n                      <!-- Links -->\r\n                      <P></P>\r\n                      <P><span id=\"lblEditLinks\"><font size=\"2\"></font></span></P>\r\n                      <P>\r\n                        <!-- Comment List --></P>\r\n                    </td>\r\n                  </tr>\r\n                </table>\r\n              </td>\r\n              <TD id=\"tdRightBar\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" width=\"100\"><span id=\"ucRightBar_lblSideBar\"><TABLE cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"6\"  width=\"100\" border=\"1\">\r\n<TR>\r\n   <TD style=\"font-size:8pt\" height=\"100%\" align=center >\r\n<a href=\"flora_page.aspx?flora_id=201\">Trees and shrubs of the Andes of Ecuador @ efloras.org</a>\r\n<hr >\r\n<b>Browse by </b><br>\r\n<a href=\"browse.aspx?flora_id=201\"> Family </a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"browse.aspx?flora_id=201&rank_id=10040